'''Chroma Seer''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that is obtainable by [[crafting]] the [[Random Painted Seers]] recipe in the crafting station or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Chroma Seer has a chromatic colored blade taking a jagged shape with black hemispheres varying in different sizes attached to it. The guard and handle are black with neon chromatic cracks. On the guard are four chromatic colored eyes of the overseer with black slit pupils, hence the name.

== Trivia ==
*It is the [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Seer]].
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/156467990/Overseer-Short-Sword Overseer Short Sword].
*It was released along with the [[Season 1]] update.
*This is one of the six [[Random Painted Seer|Random Painted Seers]], the others being the [[Red Seer]], [[Orange Seer]], [[Blue Seer]], [[Yellow Seer]] and [[Purple Seer]]. However, this is the hardest to craft out of all the colored [[Seer|Seers]] available due to it having the slimmest chance of crafting.
* This is currently the only [[Chroma Weapons|Chroma Weapon]] that is obtainable through crafting.
*It requires 10 godly [[metals]] and 10 godly [[shards]] to craft it, meaning that players need to salvage at least ten [[Seer|Seers]] and another [[Godly Weapons|godly weapon]] to obtain the required materials.
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

